                            <comment id="15902465" author="ein" created="Thu, 9 Mar 2017 04:34:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Testing done, please review&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/1599/files&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/1599/files&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16101556" author="dpavlov" created="Wed, 26 Jul 2017 11:18:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ein&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ein&quot;&gt;ein&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve checked the change and it seems to be OK.&lt;br/&gt;
In the same time e.getSuppressed() is never called. Is it indended to be logged into apache log throught printStackTrace. Is suppressed exception logged automatically or any additional change is required?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;One more question, could you please share the link to TC run? Was it in Ignite20Tests?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16101602" author="ein" created="Wed, 26 Jul 2017 12:19:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=dpavlov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;dpavlov&quot;&gt;dpavlov&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Suppressed exceptions will be automatically logged when stack trace is printed. Actually we should not worry about it.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve found only this TC run in history, related to the 1599 PR&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://195.239.208.174/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests_IgniteCache3&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeStatusDiv&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests=pull%2F1599%2Fhead&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://195.239.208.174/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests_IgniteCache3&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeStatusDiv&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests=pull%2F1599%2Fhead&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Testing was done 2 months ago after merging with the master, I think Ignite20Tests was not present at that time.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16101936" author="dpavlov" created="Wed, 26 Jul 2017 17:06:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve restarted tests for 2.0 group using RunAll chain: &lt;br/&gt;
